```
Title: HackTool - GoldenDMSA Execution
Author: Swachchhanda Shrawan Poudel (Nextron Systems)
Date: 2026-10-19
Level: high
Description: Detects execution of GoldenDMSA hacktool used for Directory Service Account manipulation.
MITRE Tactic: Persistence
Tags: attack.persistence, attack.privilege-escalation, attack.t1098, attack.credential-access, attack.t1110.001, attack.t1558.003
Reference: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_hktl_goldendmsa.yml
```
(CommandLine IN ("*wordlist*", "*bruteforce*") CommandLine="* -s *" CommandLine="*S-1-5-21-*" CommandLine="* -d *" CommandLine="* -k *") OR Image="*\\GoldenDMSA.exe"